        <div class="t-fade" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
            <div class="t-faq-item">
                <div class="t-faq-q"><h3>Do you come to my area?</h3><svg class="t-faq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg></div>
                <div class="t-faq-a"><p>We currently serve the Bay Area including San Jose, Santa Clara, Sunnyvale, Cupertino, Mountain View, Palo Alto, Fremont, Pleasanton, Dublin, Walnut Creek, San Francisco, Daly City, and surrounding communities. If you're nearby, request a visit and we'll confirm availability.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="t-faq-item">
                <div class="t-faq-q"><h3>Can I book for a group or event?</h3><svg class="t-faq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg></div>
                <div class="t-faq-a"><p>Absolutely. The mobile showroom is designed for both private demos and group events. Workplaces, communities, churches, retirement communities, and neighborhood groups can all request a visit.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="t-faq-item">
                <div class="t-faq-q"><h3>Can two people try it together?</h3><svg class="t-faq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg></div>
                <div class="t-faq-a"><p>Yes. The mobile showroom features multiple chairs so couples, partners, or colleagues can experience the chairs side by side and compare together.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="t-faq-item">
                <div class="t-faq-q"><h3>What if I'm still comparing options?</h3><svg class="t-faq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg></div>
                <div class="t-faq-a"><p>That's exactly what the demo is for. Our specialists will help you understand the meaningful differences between models — comfort, features, fit, and value — without pressure. You walk away more informed.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="t-faq-item">
                <div class="t-faq-q"><h3>Can I request a workplace or community stop?</h3><svg class="t-faq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg></div>
                <div class="t-faq-a"><p>Yes. HR teams, office managers, community organizers, and residential managers can request the truck as a wellness activation, employee appreciation event, or community pop-up.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="t-faq-item">
                <div class="t-faq-q"><h3>How long does a demo take?</h3><svg class="t-faq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg></div>
