            </div>
            <div class="t-faq-item">
                <div class="t-faq-q"><h3>Is there any obligation to buy?</h3><svg class="t-faq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg></div>
